[{"title":"游李少师园十题 和张二十五游白龙溪甘水谷郊居杂咏七首 其二","author":"范祖禹","text":"松姿鹤性自宜閒，天与幽奇避俗喧。\n谢客风流临海峤，秦人歌啸入花源。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":33688,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜直闻御沟声","author":"范祖禹","text":"银河秋泻月明中，云卷风吹下碧空。\n终夕玉堂魂梦冷，蜀江声绕水晶宫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":33689,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送周思道再知汉州三首 其三","author":"范祖禹","text":"两川相望各繁华，二牧蕃宣出一家。\n衣绣聊为乡社宠，行看召节向天涯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":33690,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送周思道再知汉州三首 其二","author":"范祖禹","text":"使君昔日抚疲羸，曾奏囊封有直词。\n一卧家山今白首，重来犹拥旧旌旗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":33691,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送周思道再知汉州三首 其一","author":"范祖禹","text":"千山行尽见平川，鸡犬相闻俗晏然。\n父老共知仁圣意，十年重借使君贤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":33692,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"原明官閒以余兼职良苦作诗见劳次韵二首 其二 言志","author":"范祖禹","text":"野性从来麋鹿游，强加冠服秪为忧。\n何时放出樊笼去，定似飞鸿上九秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":33693,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"原明官閒以余兼职良苦作诗见劳次韵二首 其一 原明","author":"范祖禹","text":"忘言象外已无求，应物环中自不忧。\n匠石旁观伤手斲，尚应皮里有阳秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":33694,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"砥柱四首 其四","author":"范祖禹","text":"砥柱初开禹力穷，黄河从此去朝宗。\n长鲸一喷连山起，岌嶪高于太华峰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":33695,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"砥柱四首 其三","author":"范祖禹","text":"禹开砥柱放河奔，浊浪轩轩日月昏。\n唯有三门君不见，惊波一起动乾坤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":33696,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"砥柱四首 其二","author":"范祖禹","text":"巨灵赑屃两山开，东放黄河万里来。\n地轴横斜争斡转，天维攲侧恐倾摧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":33697,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"砥柱四首 其一","author":"范祖禹","text":"黄河倾落九天来，砥柱三山立欲摧。\n崖谷吐吞成雾雨，蛟龙战斗作风雷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":33698,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"资中八首 其八","author":"范祖禹","text":"武侯祠庙遍空山，万古名垂宇宙间。\n昔日南人皆稽首，至今歌舞聚夷蛮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":33699,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"资中八首 其七","author":"范祖禹","text":"夷界荒山几万重，西穷月窟与天通。\n何时汉使还持节，从此乘槎上碧空。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":33700,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"资中八首 其六","author":"范祖禹","text":"风定江澄境象閒，水清波影倒云山。\n渔舟荡漾清光里，白鹭惊飞杳霭间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":33701,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"资中八首 其五","author":"范祖禹","text":"六月炎蒸烈火高，黑云驱雨驾波涛。\n千崖雪浪飞泉吼，万壑阴云古木号。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":33702,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"资中八首 其四","author":"范祖禹","text":"五月江流万贾船，迅如飞电擘群山。\n荆云峡雨须臾过，白帝江陵朝暮间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":33703,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"资中八首 其三","author":"范祖禹","text":"醮坛高倚碧天开，中有清都白玉台。\n雾拥霓旌乘月去，风吹仙乐下天来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":33704,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"资中八首 其二","author":"范祖禹","text":"资山岩谷多神仙，鸾车凤马随飞烟。\n神女萧萧来暮雨，浮丘往往下云軿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":33705,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"资中八首 其一","author":"范祖禹","text":"剑阁横空锁蜀门，资中岩岫若云屯。\n天倾白日千山砥，峡束长江万里奔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":33706,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄鲁直示千叶黄梅余因忆蜀中冬月山行江上闻香而不见花此真梅也鲁直然余言曰不得此乐久矣感而赋小诗","author":"范祖禹","text":"江上清香隔水闻，林间不见雪纷纷。\n春寒忽忆登山屐，归梦犹寻谷口云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":33707,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游李少师园十题 其八 月桂","author":"范祖禹","text":"天寒桂子堕，花发向庭中。\n月华十二满，常照此芳丛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":33708,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游李少师园十题 其二 芡池","author":"范祖禹","text":"向日铺青盖，浮波散绿盘。\n明珠洛浦佩，白玉水仙丹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":33709,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游李少师园十题 其三 笛竹","author":"范祖禹","text":"凤食实已美，龙吟声更奇。\n惜无蔡邕识，那得马融吹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":33710,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日寄诸弟","author":"范祖禹","text":"白发宜新酒，黄花似去年。\n怀归双剑路，极望九秋天。\n乔木西山外，觚棱北斗边。\n遥知行乐处，药市隐真仙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":33711,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八月十一日夜玉堂对月","author":"范祖禹","text":"银云栉栉王堂明，奁镜初开六合惊。\n天卷纤毫光不隔，风收万籁夜无声。\n蓬莱想像皆云气，宫殿虚无尽水精。\n一夕梦飞双剑外，已疑身到雪山清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":33712,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"阙题","author":"范祖禹","text":"奕世登公衮，群生入化钧。\n须知盛德后，宜有正家人。\n令日垂门帨，清风采涧蘋。\n儿孙环坐侧，岁岁祝千春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":33713,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"太皇太后挽词三首 其三","author":"范祖禹","text":"能助君成圣，惟知谏必从。\n徽音推二后，盛治见三宗。\n虚扆翔丹凤，仙輴驾玉龙。\n凄凉厚陵路，墓木拱高峰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":33714,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"太皇太后挽词三首 其二","author":"范祖禹","text":"治道初无事，齐家与正身。\n练缯躬至俭，行苇被深仁。\n受册辞隆礼，为霖属老臣。\n太平遗德在，白首泣尧民。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":33715,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"太皇太后挽词三首 其一","author":"范祖禹","text":"九载扶皇业，三朝赖母仪。\n成乾功不有，并日照无私。\n天上轩星暗，人间薤露悲。\n君王自仁孝，旧典奉元龟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":33716,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又和再寄二首 其二","author":"范祖禹","text":"花落春台静，莺啼晓枕惊。\n竹间流水过，窗外白云生。\n襟抱怀冰爽，诗篇叩玉清。\n荒唐漆园吏，环堵但披荆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":33717,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又和再寄二首 其一","author":"范祖禹","text":"青春忽已过，白发不须惊。\n招隐寻居士，论文访友生。\n到来尘虑息，归去梦魂清。\n尚想穿幽径，楸花间紫荆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":33718,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又和张给事喜雨","author":"范祖禹","text":"瞻望昭回每夜分，崇朝忽起泰山云。\n乾坤荡暑如醒醉，江海生波想织纹。\n禁漏深迷天阙晓，朝衣凉带御炉熏。\n时清封奏何妨简，献纳赓歌见爱君。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":33719,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三月十八日雨后访张二十五以诗见寄次其韵","author":"范祖禹","text":"池上鱼相乐，林间鸟不惊。\n雨馀荷气湿，风动水纹生。\n俗客心犹爽，高人兴自清。\n何时作邻里，卜宅剪榛荆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":33720,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中书侍郎傅公挽词 其二","author":"范祖禹","text":"洛社瞻贤躅，书筵继老成。\n声容陪夙昔，论议想平生。\n节与盘山峻，名随沇水清。\n草堂空旧隐，松月为谁明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":33721,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中书侍郎傅公挽词 其一","author":"范祖禹","text":"岩野为霖后，千年复有人。\n累朝推鲠直，二圣倚经纶。\n尽瘁忧民色，孤忠许国身。\n徐公德不变，可使俗还淳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":33722,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"太皇太后挽词二首 其二","author":"范祖禹","text":"授几咨元老，垂帷揽众贤。\n舜功成二十，周士得三千。\n德泽流终古，规摹遗亿年。\n宁唯照彤史，石室烂青编。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":33723,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"太皇太后挽词二首 其一","author":"范祖禹","text":"诞保天基命，光开帝永图。\n轩星临斗极，尧日上云衢。\n美化形风雅，成功入典谟。\n群生何以报，损寿济寰区。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":33724,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"王开府挽词三首 其三","author":"范祖禹","text":"连帅诸侯长，维师列爵隆。\n仪刑宪万国，眷礼视三公。\n白日年华尽，浮云世事空。\n九原伊洛上，松柏自悲风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":33725,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"王开府挽词三首 其二","author":"范祖禹","text":"康宁五福备，出入四朝安。\n剑佩逼台室，旌旄登将坛。\n天池将浴凤，云汉拟骖鸾。\n缥缈凌霞意，今成逝水叹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":33726,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"王开府挽词三首 其一","author":"范祖禹","text":"圣历当千运，天庭第一人。\n荣光亲日月，优宠极臣邻。\n贾马推先进，夔龙接后尘。\n藩垣赖耆德，宣力至终身。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":33727,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"王岐公挽词三首 其三","author":"范祖禹","text":"王俭风流相，岐公博赡资。\n敷文成国典，亮采作官师。\n剑佩空黄閤，音容想赤墀。\n元臣葬礼盛，箫吹朔风悲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":33728,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"王岐公挽词三首 其二","author":"范祖禹","text":"乘云仙驭远，出震帝图新。\n百辟瞻元宰，繁机仗老臣。\n中天扶日月，拱极失星辰。\n终始先朝遇，勤劳至没身。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe